#. module: l10n_cz_kh
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_cz_kh.field_account_tax__cssk_kh_commodity_code
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_cz_kh.field_product_product__cssk_kh_commodity_code
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_cz_kh.field_product_template__cssk_kh_commodity_code
msgid ""
"Commodity code for the VAT control statement (§92a reverse charge), reported"
" in sections A.1 (supplier) and B.1 (customer): 1 = gold, 3 = supply of "
"immovable property, 4 = construction or assembly work, 5 = goods listed in "
"Annex 5, 6 = goods originally provided as a guarantee, 7 = goods after an "
"assigned retention of title, 11 = greenhouse-gas emission allowances, 12 = "
"cereals and technical crops, 13 = metals, 14 = mobile phones, 15 = "
"integrated circuits, 16 = portable data-processing devices, 17 = video game "
"consoles, 18 = electricity certificates, 19 = electricity to a trader, 20 = "
"gas to a trader, 21 = specified electronic communications services; 1a, 3a "
"and 4a as the form defines them. Set it on the reverse-charge tax or on the "
"product."
msgstr ""
"Kód predmetu plnenia pre kontrolné hlásenie DPH (prenesenie daňovej "
"povinnosti podľa §92a), vykazuje sa v oddieloch A.1 (dodávateľ) a B.1 "
"(odberateľ): 1 = zlato, 3 = dodanie nehnuteľnosti, 4 = stavebné alebo "
"montážne práce, 5 = tovar uvedený v prílohe 5, 6 = tovar pôvodne poskytnutý "
"ako záruka, 7 = tovar po postúpenej výhrade vlastníctva, 11 = povolenky na "
"emisie skleníkových plynov, 12 = obilniny a technické plodiny, 13 = kovy, 14"
" = mobilné telefóny, 15 = integrované obvody, 16 = prenosné zariadenia na "
"spracovanie údajov, 17 = herné konzoly, 18 = certifikáty elektriny, 19 = "
"elektrina obchodníkovi, 20 = plyn obchodníkovi, 21 = vymedzené elektronické "
"komunikačné služby; 1a, 3a a 4a podľa vymedzenia vo formulári. Nastavte ho "
